# What the alarm scenario does not reach. An alert whose value is undefined, and one that never ran: their colors.
# An alert found through its chart's NAME: C's second key is made with the chart's name where the keys are made with
# chart ids, so it finds the alert of another chart whose id is that name. An alarm's name past the key's 1,023
# bytes.
rules tests/corpus/badge/badge.conf
chart b.un b.un_name b.undef fam things 1
chart b.id b.id_name b.idle fam things 1
chart b.x b.x_name b.none fam things 1
chart b.x_name b.other b.byname fam things 1
var b.id v 70
var b.x_name v 70
collected b.id 0 0
clock 0
pass 0
clock 1
pass 1
badge chart=b.un&alarm=b_undef
badge chart=b.id&alarm=b_idle
badge chart=b.x&alarm=b_name
badge chart=b.x_name&alarm=b_name
badge chart=b.other&alarm=b_name
badge chart=b.x&alarm=b_name&refresh=auto
badge chart=b.x&
